    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx 62sqm / 667sq ft.\n\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 649 Carnlough Road to the market, a charming two bedroom home ideally positioned in the established and highly sought-after area of Cabra. Offering well-proportioned accommodation of approximately 62 sq. m., this property provides an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors alike.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance porch and hallway, a bright and comfortable living room with timber flooring, a well-appointed kitchen with a generous range of fitted units and ample workspace. The kitchen also provides access to the rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from fitted wardrobes, along with a newly fitted fully tiled family bathroom featuring an electric shower and heated towel rail. The property also benefits from access to the attic, providing useful additional storage.\n\nExternally, the home enjoys a generous front garden with a pathway leading to the front entrance, while the rear provides a private outdoor space with excellent potential for further enhancement. A detached timber garden room/shed offers valuable additional storage or workspace.\n\nLocated on Carnlough Road, the property is within easy reach of a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and excellent transport links, with Dublin City Centre also readily accessible.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.74m (5'9\") x 0.7m (2'4\")\nPvc double doors with tiled floor coverings.\n\nHallway - 1.74m (5'9\") x 2.87m (9'5\")\nComposite hall doors with wood effect tiled floor coverings.\n\nLiving Room - 3m (9'10\") x 3.81m (12'6\")\nWith laminate floor covering.\n\nKitchen - 4.83m (15'10\") x 3.11m (10'2\")\nWith wood effect tiled flooring, range of modern kitchen units & plumbed for washing machine.\n\nUtility\nTiled backsplash, extractor fan & composite door to rear garden.\n\nLanding - 1.84m (6'0\") x 0.96m (3'2\")\nWith laminate floor coverings & access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.83m (15'10\") x 3.33m (10'11\")\nto the front of the property with fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.23m (10'7\") x 2.62m (8'7\")\nTo the rear of the property with laminate wood floor coverings & fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.5m (4'11\") x 1.68m (5'6\")\nFully tiled walls and floor. Walk in electric power shower, w.c., vanity unit & heated towel rail.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious Front Garden </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Off Street Parking </li><li> Broombridge train station close by </li><li> Ample storage space</li></ul>"
